      <title>In support of public safety - The Journal of the San Juan Islands</title>
      <link>https://www.sanjuanjournal.com/2026/03/29/in-support-of-public-safety/</link>
      <description>I am writing to express my strong support for voting YES on the levy lid lift that will be on the April 28 special election ballot. As the former Sheriff of San Juan County for 24 years, I have witnessed firsthand the vital role our law enforcement officials and staff play in keeping our community safe.</description>
